                }
              }
            },
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Artists of the OPM top 30 (Spotify Top 50 PH + Viral Hits PH + Billboard PH Hot 100) who never played for NDN (any release date counts). Each part is 0-100: 100 = best of all artists checked, 50 = middle; % = its weight; no data = 0'"
                }
              }
            },
            "fontSize": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "9D"
                }
              }
            },
            "fontFamily": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Segoe UI'"
                }
              }
            },
            "fontColor": {
              "solid": {
                "color": {
                  "expr": {
                    "Literal": {
                      "Value": "'#9a8b70'"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "alignment": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'left'"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "visualHeaderTooltip": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'#: Place by invite score among the artists the page filters leave (1 = best).\nArtist: Spotify artist name; 4 letters of the Spotify ID are added when two artists share a name.\nInvite score: The nine parts added up with their weights: TikTok 55, Spotify 30, other 15. Each part scores 0-100 against all artists checked (100 = top, 50 = middle, no data = 0). Higher = better to invite now.\nTikTok points (of 55): The four TikTok parts after weighting.\nSpotify points (of 30): The three Spotify parts after weighting.\nOther points (of 15): Fan requests and artist size after weighting.\nTikTok videos using the new song 25%: All TikTok videos using the new song (its official sound plus versions found by searching its title on TikTok every 3 days), as a 0-100 score against all artists checked. Weight 25%.\nGrowth of those videos 15%: How fast those videos grew over 4 weeks, as a 0-100 score against all artists checked. Weight 15%. 0 for everyone until the second weekly count (Mon 26 Oct 2026).\nArtist''s TikTok follower growth 10%: Follower growth of the artist''s TikTok over 4 weeks (public profile, weekly), as a 0-100 score against all artists checked. Weight 10%.\nHow their NDN posts did 5%: How the artist''s past NDN TikToks and YouTube sessions did compared with NDN''s usual, as a 0-100 score against all artists checked. New artists get 50. Weight 5%.\nNew song''s Spotify plays 15%: Daily Spotify plays of the new song (kworb.net), as a 0-100 score against all artists checked. Weight 15%.\nSpotify PH chart 10%: Best place on Spotify''s Philippines weekly chart in the last 8 weeks, as a 0-100 score against all artists checked. Weight 10%.\nListeners in Manila + Baguio 5%: Spotify listeners in Metro Manila and Baguio (half credit for the rest of the Philippines), from the artist''s top 5 cities, as a 0-100 score against all artists checked. Weight 5%.\nFan requests 10%: Fans asking for the artist in NDN comments per 1,000 comments, as a 0-100 score against all artists checked. Weight 10%.\nArtist size 5%: Spotify monthly listeners, as a 0-100 score against all artists checked. Weight 5%.'"
